---
// You can import fonts or global styles up here later if you expand!
---
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Fruiting Currents</title>
    <!-- Importing an elegant display serif and clean body font -->
    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
    <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Cinzel:wght@400&family=Playfair+Display:ital@1&family=Plus+Jakarta+Sans:wght@300;400&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
</head>
<body>

    <!-- Subtle background gradient mist effect -->
    <div class="bg-mist"></div>

    <div class="container">
        <header class="main-header">
            <h1>Fruiting Currents</h1>
        </header>

        <!-- Abstract holographic gradient block -->
        <div class="artwork-window">
            <!-- You can leave this as a pure CSS gradient or overlay your own transparent PNG illustration later -->
        </div>

        <main class="links-wrapper">
            
            <section class="link-node">
                <a href="https://yoursubstack.substack.com" class="main-link" target="_blank">The Substack Journal</a>
                <p class="description">Essays on cyclical transitions, somatic ecology, and currents beneath the surface.</p>
            </section>

            <section class="link-node">
                <a href="#booking-link" class="main-link">Natal Astrology Readings</a>
                <p class="description">An archival look at your birth chart blueprint to map out personal structural timing.</p>
            </section>

            <section class="link-node">
                <a href="#divination-link" class="main-link">Divination Sessions</a>
                <p class="description">Symbolic imagery consulting for clarity on projects, internal blocks, and transformation cycles.</p>
            </section>

            <div class="divider"></div>

            <section class="about-node">
                <h2>About Me</h2>
                <p class="about-text">A creative practitioner merging traditional symbolic modalities with clinical frameworks, holding space for structural alignment.</p>
            </section>

        </main>
    </div>

</body>
</html>

<style>
    /* Styling System */
    * { box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0; padding: 0; }
    
    body {
        background-color: #f6f3f0; /* Soft warm linen background */
        color: #2a2825;
        font-family: 'Plus Jakarta Sans', sans-serif;
        min-height: 100vh;
        padding: 4rem 1.5rem;
        position: relative;
        overflow-x: hidden;
    }

    /* Ambient background aura */
    .bg-mist {
        position: absolute;
        top: -10%;
        right: -10%;
        width: 100%;
        height: 100%;
        background: radial-gradient(circle at 80% 20%, rgba(243, 215, 215, 0.5) 0%, rgba(213, 226, 235, 0.4) 50%, rgba(246, 243, 240, 0) 100%);
        z-index: 0;
        pointer-events: none;
    }

    .container {
        position: relative;
        z-index: 1;
        max-width: 500px;
        margin: 0 auto;
    }

    .main-header {
        text-align: center;
        margin-bottom: 2.5rem;
    }

    .main-header h1 {
        font-family: 'Cinzel', serif;
        font-weight: 400;
        font-size: clamp(1.8rem, 5vw, 2.4rem);
        letter-spacing: 0.08em;
        text-transform: uppercase;
        color: #3a3530;
    }

    /* The visual center block */
    .artwork-window {
        width: 100%;
        height: 240px;
        /* Custom soft abstract gradient design */
        background: linear-gradient(135deg, #e3dcd5 0%, #d4cbd6 40%, #cce0df 80%, #ebdcd5 100%);
        border-radius: 2px;
        margin-bottom: 3.5rem;
        border: 1px solid rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.02);
    }

    .links-wrapper {
        display: flex;
        flex-direction: column;
        gap: 2.5rem;
        text-align: center;
    }

    .link-node {
        display: flex;
        flex-direction: column;
        align-items: center;
    }

    .main-link {
        font-family: 'Playfair Display', serif;
        font-style: italic;
        font-size: 1.25rem;
        color: #2a2825;
        text-decoration: none;
        border-bottom: 1px solid #2a2825;
        padding-bottom: 2px;
        margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
        transition: opacity 0.3s ease;
    }

    .main-link:hover {
        opacity: 0.5;
    }

    .description {
        font-size: 0.85rem;
        line-height: 1.5;
        color: #6a635a;
        font-weight: 300;
        max-width: 380px;
    }

    .divider {
        width: 40px;
        height: 1px;
        background-color: #e2ded9;
        margin: 0.5rem auto;
    }

    .about-node h2 {
        font-size: 0.75rem;
        font-weight: 600;
        letter-spacing: 0.15em;
        text-transform: uppercase;
        color: #4a453f;
        margin-bottom: 0.6rem;
    }

    .about-text {
        font-size: 0.85rem;
        line-height: 1.6;
        color: #5a534a;
        font-weight: 300;
    }
</style>